WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.710
Halley's Comet

2
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:16.360
Comes around more than I do

3
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:24.970
But you're all it takes for me to break a promise

4
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.950
Silly me to fall in love with you

5
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:34.370
I haven't slept since Sunday

6
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:43.610
Midnight for me is 3:00 a.m. for you

7
00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.190
But my sleepless nights are better

8
00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:57.260
With you than nights could ever be alone, ooh-ooh-ooh

9
00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:03.920
I was good at feeling nothing, now I'm hopeless

10
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:10.180
What a drag to love you like I do, ooh-ooh, ooh, ooh

